JRBrown wrote:
>
> The simplest way to kill a priest (or
> any other peaceful) is to have your pet do it; if that's not an
> option, try to stay out of melee range...

The game supplies nearly unlimited rocks and other weapons.  Priests
are to be killed with missile combat.  If you run out of missiles and
the priest is still alive then you didn't bring 300+ rocks to your dug
out prepared location.

With missile combat the biggest risk is insect generation.  Start firing
whatever missile you can get expert at and keep firing those until the
priest is dead or you run out.  Then other missle weapons then the
unlimited rocks.


